"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-24T07:17:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:59Z","closed_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\ngodot   4.X  All Version\n\n\n### System information\n\nwindows11 , AMD Ryzen 7900, 48GB , RTX4060ti , DX12,vulkan\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116649\n\nIn the previous link, the example was too complicated, so it seemed that the person in charge misunderstood the problem. Therefore, I simplified it.\n\nOne thing certain is that if a node is deleted while it is using a coroutine with await, the local objects inside the coroutine are not destroyed (they are not cleared).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```\n# main.gd\nextends Node2D\n\nvar test_node: Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\ttest_node = preload(\"res://TestNode.gd\").new()\n\tadd_child(test_node)\n\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(5.0).timeout\n\n\tif is_instance_valid(test_node):\n\t\tprint(\"[Main] delete test_node\")\n\t\ttest_node.queue_free()\n\t\ttest_node = null\n\n```\n\n```\n# TestNode.gd\nextends Node\n\nclass TestClass extends RefCounted:\n\tfunc _notification(what):\n\t\tif what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:\n\t\t\tprint(\"[TestClass] PREDELETE\")\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\tprint(\"[TestNode] exit_tree\")\n\t\t\t\t\t\nfunc _ready() -> void:\t\n\tprint(\"[TestNode] ready\")\n\t_run()\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\t##  this TestClass instance is not cleared\n\tvar test = TestClass.new()\n\twhile is_inside_tree():\n\t\tprint(\"[TestNode] tick: \", Time.get_ticks_msec())\n\t\tawait get_tree().create_timer(0.5).timeout\n```\n\n\n in the main.gd source code, a TestNode is created and then deleted after 5 seconds.\n\nIn TestNode.gd, the run function is a coroutine running an infinite loop.\nThe problem is that inside this coroutine there is a local variable TestClass. Even though the coroutine is deleted, the memory for this local variable is not released (its destructor is not called).\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[coroutine-problem.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25510782/coroutine-problem.zip)\n\n\n[output]\n[TestNode] ready\n[TestNode] tick: 521\n[TestNode] tick: 1023\n[TestNode] tick: 1526\n[TestNode] tick: 2029\n[TestNode] tick: 2533\n[TestNode] tick: 3035\n[TestNode] tick: 3533\n[TestNode] tick: 4036\n[TestNode] tick: 4539\n[TestNode] tick: 5042\n[Main] delete test_node\n[TestNode] exit_tree\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116706/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}